            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.36.5+2CH.36.6+2CH.36.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Imila 36:5-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo Yehoyakimu mwana Yosia ateekele icalo ca Yuda, ishiwi lyakwa Yawe lyaishile kuli Yeremia aliti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kabiye ku ba mu lupwa lwa bena Rekabu, uye landa nabo. Elyo wise nabo, ubengishe na mu muputule umo uwa mu ŋanda yakwa Yawe, ubapeeleko no mwangashi, banwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
